-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party model weights
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

omr_model.onnx — "OMR Checkbox Classifier" (SmallOMRNet)
  Source    : https://huggingface.co/hermitkk/omr-checkbox-classifier
  Revision  : 046c24e341099033cc565fa5ff0fbaea01fde938 (pinned)
  SHA-256   : ada735da9eef990edc82e0c98c0621426b8b85bc35f204e3256f7ea89057e115
  Licence   : AGPL-3.0
  Developer : Chenfeng Xu (UBC), supervised by Prof. Andrew Rechnitzer and
              Prof. Colin B. MacDonald, for the Plom Project
              (https://gitlab.com/plom/plom)

The weights are NOT stored in this repository. scripts/fetch-weights.sh
downloads them at the pinned revision and verifies the SHA-256 above.

The preprocessing (crop with padding, Otsu threshold, 64x64 resize,
normalisation to [-1, 1], sigmoid on the logit) follows the model card.
